<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <title>Account Deletion Scheduled</title>
  </head>
  <body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #f5f5f5; padding: 20px;">
    <table width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px;">
      <tr>
        <td>
          <h2 style="color: #333333;">Account Deletion Scheduled</h2>

          <% if (name) { %>
            <p style="color: #555555;">Hi <%= name %>,</p>
          <% } %>

          <p style="color: #555555;">
            Your CampusHub account has been scheduled for deletion. Your account and all associated data will be permanently deleted on:
          </p>

          <p style="text-align: center; margin: 20px 0;">
            <strong style="font-size: 18px; color: #dc2626;"><%= deletionDate %></strong>
          </p>

          <p style="color: #555555;">
            You have <strong><%= gracePeriodDays %> days</strong> to change your mind. If you want to keep your account, simply log in to CampusHub before the deletion date and your account will be restored automatically.
          </p>

          <div style="background-color: #fef2f2; border: 1px solid #fecaca; border-radius: 4px; padding: 15px; margin: 20px 0;">
            <p style="color: #991b1b; margin: 0; font-size: 14px;">
              <strong>What will be deleted:</strong><br />
              - Your profile information<br />
              - Your listings and housing posts<br />
              - Your verification documents<br />
              - Your wallet balance (forfeited)
            </p>
          </div>

          <div style="background-color: #f0fdf4; border: 1px solid #bbf7d0; border-radius: 4px; padding: 15px; margin: 20px 0;">
            <p style="color: #166534; margin: 0; font-size: 14px;">
              <strong>What will be kept:</strong><br />
              - Your reviews and ratings<br />
              - Chat message history (for other users)<br />
              - Transaction records (for auditing)
            </p>
          </div>

          <p style="color: #999999; font-size: 12px;">
            If you did not request this deletion, please log in to your account immediately to cancel it, or contact our support team.
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </body>
</html>
